sequenceDiagram
    participant Runtime as Runtime Engine
    participant Collector as Collector (Win/Lin)
    participant Crypto as Crypto Primitives
    participant Store as Evidence Store

    Runtime->>Collector: execute(action, params, context)
    Collector->>Collector: Perform Collection\n(raw bytes, metadata)
    Collector->>Crypto: blake3(evidence_bytes)
    Crypto-->>Collector: payload_hash
    Collector->>Crypto: Ed25519_sign(payload_hash || evidence_id || timestamp, collector_privkey)
    Crypto-->>Collector: signature
    Collector->>Collector: Build EvidenceReceipt\n{id, evidence_id, run_id, collector, version,\n signature, public_key, payload_hash, payload_hash_algo,\n timestamp, host_info}
    Collector-->>Runtime: Evidence + EvidenceReceipt
    Runtime->>Store: Persist Evidence (file)\nPersist Receipt (DB)\nCreate Provenance Record (action="collected")
    Store-->>Runtime: OK
    Runtime->>Runtime: Verify Receipt Immediately\n(verify sig, recompute hash, check timestamp)
    alt Verification Failed
        Runtime->>Runtime: Abort / Alert
    else Verification Passed
        Runtime->>Runtime: Continue Pipeline
    end